# =====================================================================
# Release V072 -- Exam Ratio: HEX-included + Dentist-scoped
# =====================================================================
# Exam Ratio read too low (all practitioners in the denominator; HEX excluded from
# the numerator). Two changes:
#  - Aggregate Exam_Count now counts Reason LIKE '%Exam%' OR '%HEX%' (HEX = combined
#    Exam + Hygiene). Interim until the appointment reason-map lands.
#  - Fact_Metric_Actuals exam_ratio computed over DENTIST practitioners only (num + den)
#    via a dentist-only #exam aggregate.
# Dev T100: ~22% -> ~59%.
#
# NB: re-deploying these two SPs also carries their accumulated fixes (aggregate =
# chair-util V065 + short-notice V070; metric-actuals = the active-denominator
# email/phone fix). Rebuild the aggregate -> Fact_Metric_Actuals -> model after deploy.
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V072__exam_ratio_hex_dentist.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Gold.usp_Load_Aggregate_Site_Patient_Practitioner_Daily.StoredProcedure.sql
DEPLOY  Fabric\Gold.usp_Load_Fact_Metric_Actuals.StoredProcedure.sql

TEST
